==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|genuflexion}} (''British'')

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# the act of [[genuflect]]ing
#* '''1820''', {{w|Percy Bysshe Shelley}}, ''Oedipus Tyrannus; Or, Swellfoot The Tyrant: A Tragedy in Two Acts'':
#*: Those impious Pigs,<br>Who, by frequent squeaks, have dared impugn<br>The settled Swellfoot system, or to make<br>Irreverent mockery of the '''genuflexions'''<br>Inculcated by the arch-priest, have been whipt<br>Into a loyal and an orthodox whine.

